SCCI_RH S4 restricted closed-loop current-driver surrogate
Vhv hv 0 24
Vset set 0 0.29998779296875
.model BR SW(Ron=10 Roff=1e12 Vt=1.65 Vh=0)
.model MX SW(Ron=2 Roff=1e12 Vt=1.65 Vh=0)
.model FET NMOS(Level=1 Vto=1.3 Kp=0.05 Lambda=0.005)
.model CLAMP D(Is=1e-12 N=1 Rs=1)
Vplus0 cp0 0 PWL(0 0 0.0004 0 0.000400001 3.3 0.0006 3.3 0.000600001 0)
Vminus0 cm0 0 PWL(0 0 0.0007 0 0.000700001 3.3 0.0009 3.3 0.000900001 0)
Brun0 run0 0 V={max(v(cp0),v(cm0))}
Boff0 off0 0 V={3.3-v(run0)}
Bfbctl0 fc0 0 V={v(run0)}
Bfboff0 foff0 0 V={3.3-v(fc0)}
S1_0 hv a0 cp0 0 BR
S4_0 dr0 br0 cp0 0 BR
S2_0 hv br0 cm0 0 BR
S3_0 dr0 a0 cm0 0 BR
Rpair0 a0 pol0 1000
Cpol0 pol0 ret0 2e-06 IC=0
Rpol0 pol0 ret0 100k
Rshunt0 ret0 br0 2
Rfeedback0 sense0 0 100
Rgate0 muxg0 gate0 330
Rpull0 gate0 0 100k
Cgs0 gate0 sense0 7e-11
Cgd0 gate0 dr0 10p
Cds0 dr0 sense0 1.2p
Sgate_on0 amp0 muxg0 run0 0 MX
Sgate_off0 0 muxg0 off0 0 MX
Sfeedback_on0 sense0 fb0 fc0 0 MX
Sfeedback_off0 amp0 fb0 foff0 0 MX
Cinput0 fb0 0 5p IC=0.29998779296875
